      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can now use more specific statuses to give your team and agents shared context about what&rsquo;s in flight and what to work on next, then visualize your progress with repository boards.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Choose a status when creating an issue or change it from the issue header.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You&rsquo;ll see it reflected in issue icons across the repository issues page, the issues dashboard , and repository boards, where you can use the status: filter to find the issues you&rsquo;re looking for.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Linking a draft pull request to an issue moves the issue to In progress .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Linking an open pull request to an issue moves the issue to In review .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Previously, issue fields other than Priority required mapping to an issue type to be shown on an issue.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With this change, you can now add any issue field to an issue regardless of the type through the cog ⚙️ menu in the fields section of the issue sidebar.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.516Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Issue artifacts are now in public preview",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-23-issue-statuses-and-repository-boards-are-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T20:37:11.000Z",
